Why this file exists: @resvg/resvg-wasm (used by lib/svg-raster.ts to
rasterize QR frame SVGs to PNG) ships no system fonts, so SVG <text>
elements rendered nothing under Cloudflare Workers. The framed QR styles
in lib/qr-generator.ts request "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" for titles
(openly licensed, so bundled verbatim) and "Consolas, monospace" for
labels; lib/svg-raster.ts registers this face as the sans-serif,
monospace, and default family, so both stacks resolve to it. Served as a
static asset only — never bundled into the Worker script.
